omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V8SxJlsL5pUQ7kNvwE0ouSG&_nc_oc=Adqf77xDbMzqTu3jyHQq62Sz7O6bTiEAGR2al9OD4CEYL05rqqLaAAazLSUorFFKGTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9m_XrnCE6ZQ6BO3-oQsiT_B5g3sId3vP0IubST4zIXXQ&oe=6A4530B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QcOAJ8XtTBUQ7kNvwF6223e&_nc_oc=Adq5bvuZeRcxZTrQDDHhnJb7EnfiDEdjGPTlj4EK7QGYRTMMIR6eE4VGKC-y5Stv1dg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_HTEo7DTOcmn9fwDqsJelQpWt2oEeJwmrv1Dp5WtaGEA&oe=6A453216"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WLLnsK0OS70Q7kNvwEigODq&_nc_oc=AdpstByesvLwjBebpsf_Wu6YiOLrYNOZMxsDvgkeNpsMsoR6B2ZXaiwe1klcJGQq-Mk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9PwKyVsa-iuHf884GXGn0XzoP_-4lilK0y0vK2iYJ9Vg&oe=6A450EF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://